msgid "KSudoku"
msgstr "KSudoku"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.ksudoku.appdata.xml:15
msgid "Complete a numeric puzzle with the numbers from one to nine"
msgstr "Riješite brojčanu mozgalicu brojevima od jedan do devet"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.ksudoku.appdata.xml:17
msgid "KSudoku is a free version of the popular logic game Sudoku developed by the KDE community. The game is to fill a nine by nine grid with the numbers from one to nine filling the rows, columns and three by three squares without repeating a value on them."
msgstr "KSudoku je besplatna inačica popularne logičke igre sudoku koju je razvila zajednica KDE. Cilj je popuniti mrežu veličine devet puta devet brojevima od jedan do devet, tako da se u redcima, stupcima i kvadratima veličine tri puta tri ne ponavlja nijedna vrijednost."
